cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GenomicIR-NLP: Agentic GraphRAG over a scientific paper corpus"
authors:
  - family-names: "Saravanakumar"
    given-names: "Aadhavan Arkhash"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arkhash0309/GenomicIR-NLP"
url: "https://github.com/arkhash0309/GenomicIR-NLP"
abstract: >-
  An agentic GraphRAG application over 7,070 bioRxiv genomics papers, combining
  hybrid retrieval (FAISS semantic + BM25 lexical + reciprocal rank fusion +
  cross-encoder reranking), scispaCy biomedical NER, a NetworkX knowledge graph,
  and a streaming Claude tool-use agent, with a React + D3 frontend.
keywords:
  - graphrag
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - knowledge-graph
  - faiss
  - llm-agent
  - genomics
  - fastapi
  - react
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
